  <h3>Ginwala   Enquiry, 2008</h3>
  <p>Report of the Enquiry into the <a href="2008_ginwala.pdf" target="_blank" onClick="_gaq.push(['_trackEvent', 'PDF', 'Download', '/downloads/commsission-ginwala'); ">fitness of Advocate VP Pikoli to hold the office</a> of National Director of Public Prosecutions (As published by the GCIS) </p>
